Banking-system

Main:
    -Main

BankSystem:

    -Manages instances from the class Person and Girocard
    -Creates Instances from the class Person and Girocard
    -Creates Girocard and assigns it to a Person


Person:
    -Name
    -Date of Birth
    -Age (auto calculated)
    -Occupation
    -Girocard

Girocard:
    -Name
    -Company
    -Expiration Date
    -IBAN (auto generated)
    -PIN (auto generated)
    -Balance
    -Extract/Deposit
    -Transfer
    -Banking history

